{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5000_situation", "source_sha256": "1074fb73692fbd363b0b70c5f97b167c0a43d1897171b2b4fc9df17ada2f27c9", "ja": "ホラー特番の撮影", "zh": "拍摄恐怖特别节目", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5000_place", "source_sha256": "0dda4ca399b5144a59c85267778a2be30b3feba9305c83ddc9f6cba03afc9a6a", "ja": "学校（夜）", "zh": "学校（夜晚）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5001_p", "source_sha256": "d8dfff9ba1a2dc965bfc7f2e07de781403a83b3f577e212fa2dfad1fc8701961", "ja": "（今日はエミリーとバラエティの撮影に来ている。\n学校の怪談がテーマの、肝試し感覚のコーナーだ）", "zh": "（今天和艾米莉一起来参加综艺拍摄。这是一个以校园怪谈为主题、让人体验试胆感觉的环节）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5002_032emi", "source_sha256": "9a1e7ef0e848417dd303caabd937e90aeac12fde153fd006a9e2df1a4d0c093b", "ja": "あ、あの、仕掛け人さま……私、少しだけ怖く\nなってきてしまって……ほ、本当に少しだけですが！", "zh": "那、那个，制作人先生……我、我开始有点害怕了……真、真的只有一点点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5003_p", "source_sha256": "5ea08ea90f452f8f72d25dc8c8f9d1a4efeb93c734031c96ee9b547397a177b5", "ja": "夜の学校って、さすがに雰囲気あるよな……。\n照明、もう少し強くしてもらおうか？", "zh": "夜晚的学校，确实挺有氛围的啊……\n要让他们把照明调亮一点吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5004_032emi", "source_sha256": "dd39ce2c0b61b31a8bd6c4f02b47fa77552f2d4f2316d0a4951d937178e70b74", "ja": "い、いえ、大丈夫です！　すみません……私、\nきちんと覚悟をしてきたはずなのに……。", "zh": "不、不用，我没事的！对不起……我明明\n已经做好了充分的心理准备……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5005_032emi", "source_sha256": "7826b94f412247c1bce6ec74c9fac676c4c6c97d8f93c2a04e9341e061016696", "ja": "こんなことでは、いけませんよね！　大和撫子として、\nどんな時でも、凛とした姿をお見せしなくては。", "zh": "这样可不行，对吧！作为大和抚子，\n无论什么时候，都必须展现出端庄的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5006_p", "source_sha256": "a846ae5edacf80dc678140b4b2a838ba26094e79cb1a930573ad48ff0987e029", "ja": "凛とした姿か、そうだな……よし！", "zh": "要保持端庄的姿态吗，说得对……好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5007", "source_sha256": "851e6fd55ec2374b4955613db952e8c7ee7991525482c3290537b13f8dca191f", "ja": "そのままでいい", "zh": "保持这样就好", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5008", "source_sha256": "ff16e1c67a4b44dec3c99ca4ec39ab2638facfad974cda2f4e207e4e13f0d8d5", "ja": "仕込みの場所を教える", "zh": "告知演出的地点", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5200_p", "source_sha256": "1a2efa4a2b3b17b7fc51c06757606b69efb9c74e01969d305657019cfab0fb03", "ja": "いや、むしろ……ファンのみんなは、\nありのままのエミリーの反応が見たいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "不，倒不如说……粉丝们\n应该更想看到艾米莉最真实的反应吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5201_032emi", "source_sha256": "a34b85419d4f8e52045e55d72bebfdd6cdea60b0a0b2a368db1d6ab5ec945add", "ja": "なるほど……！　そういえば大和撫子が\n驚いた顔なども、『撮れ高』と言うのでしたよね？", "zh": "原来如此……！这么说来，大和抚子露出惊讶表情之类的，也可以称作“拍摄成果”，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5202_032emi", "source_sha256": "2285b4fd231b377378ea5b5ace268494da0228c9e5c7bd1c377d21a12fe5ad1a", "ja": "怖がる私を見て、喜んでくださるごヒイキ様が\nいらっしゃるのなら……頑張ります！　いざっ。", "zh": "只要有捧场客大人愿意看到我害怕的\n样子而感到开心……我就会加油的！这就去也。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5300_p", "source_sha256": "1a2efa4a2b3b17b7fc51c06757606b69efb9c74e01969d305657019cfab0fb03", "ja": "いや、むしろ……ファンのみんなは、\nありのままのエミリーの反応が見たいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "不，倒不如说……粉丝们\n应该更想看到艾米莉最真实的反应吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5301_032emi", "source_sha256": "125a4f2aed3918b0eebefd23c6e183d8cb986581238eacf1df59c0bf958de9f3", "ja": "ありのままの……わ、わかりました！\n恥ずかしいような気もいたしますが……頑張りますね！", "zh": "真实的……我、我明白了！\n虽然感觉有点难为情……但我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5302_032emi", "source_sha256": "dbe536d2b427988d88315366a62bbb63152ba669722bd3d62b73fe7800eae994", "ja": "でも、あの……まだ時間がありますし、もう少しだけ、\nお喋りしていてくださいませんか？　うぅ……！", "zh": "不过，那个……反正还有时间，能不能再陪我聊一小会儿？呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5500_p", "source_sha256": "1c2f80f0468d3c5093682044c4936eeb660c603178a390220258c5933763d997", "ja": "驚かせられるポイントがわかれば、少しは怖くなくなる\nんじゃないか？　こっそり教えておくよ。", "zh": "要是知道了会被吓到的点，是不是就没那么害怕了？我悄悄告诉你吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5501_032emi", "source_sha256": "a4461adb64720781d4ae3dad486881f0be998bc6d8a1328b68367ffd74e3340c", "ja": "い、いいのですか？　ありがとうございます……！\nそれなら、大丈夫かもしれません……。", "zh": "可、可以吗？非常感谢您……！\n那样的话，说不定就没问题了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5502_032emi", "source_sha256": "8672d0a4f6f51048103545f7471c3a503cc049f03eb283e3310ccb0236156a18", "ja": "あ、でも……でしたら、わざとらしくならないように、\n驚く練習をしなければいけませんね……きゃ、きゃー？", "zh": "啊，不过……既然这样，为了不显得太刻意，\n我得练习一下该怎么表现惊讶才行呢……呀、呀——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5600_p", "source_sha256": "1c2f80f0468d3c5093682044c4936eeb660c603178a390220258c5933763d997", "ja": "驚かせられるポイントがわかれば、少しは怖くなくなる\nんじゃないか？　こっそり教えておくよ。", "zh": "要是知道了会被吓到的点，是不是就没那么害怕了？我悄悄告诉你吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5601_032emi", "source_sha256": "865eec4f26e87c0367a8ca0021c6299be3768f496a12d89a5f77ae43efa0e372", "ja": "はっ。そ、それは、とてもありがたいのですが……。\nなんだかちょっと、ずるいような？", "zh": "啊。这、这确实非常感谢……可是，总觉得好像有点狡猾？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_5602_032emi", "source_sha256": "eec05ee79531dbad0530eba901d27a22d9d65edfe078570d88bbaa4bf93ec755", "ja": "あの……だ、大丈夫です！　このまま頑張ってみます！\nおばけなんて、怖くありませんから……う、うぅっ。", "zh": "那个……没、没关系！我会就这样努力试试看！\n我才不怕什么鬼呢……呜、呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
